<title>JAPAN: Hosiden shares fall sharply on Hitachi LCD move.</title>
<headline>Hosiden shares fall sharply on Hitachi LCD move.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Hosiden Corp fell sharply on Wednesday morning after Hitachi Ltd said it would not buy liquid crystal displays (LCDs) from the company for the time being.</p>
<p>By 0127 GMT Hosiden shares were down 45 yen at 924 yen on the Osaka Securities Exchange (OSE).</p>
